                %em A topos-theoretic approach to Stone-type dualities
                (
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1103.3493"}> arXiv:1103.3493
                )
          %p
            The relation to
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/locally+finitely+presentable+categories"} locally finitely presentable categories
            is discussed in
          %ul#Porst
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Hans+Porst"}> Hans Porst
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Algebraic lattices and locally finitely presentable categories
              = succeed "," do
