              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1007/s00012-011-0129-0"} https://doi.org/10.1007/s00012-011-0129-0
              (
              %a{:href => "http://www.math.uni-bremen.de/~porst/dvis/PORST_AlgebraicLattices_revfinAU.pdf"}> pdf
              )
          %p That every algebraic lattice is a congruence lattice is proved in
          %ul
            %li
